{"id":"005f78978592c0bb","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations.md","title":"Definition — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含","display":"Definition — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations","aliases":["14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations"],"display":"Definition — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含","source_ref":"III.8, pp.145–147","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"III.8, pp.145–147"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,A_i\\subseteq F\">\\(A,B,A_i\\subseteq F\\)</span> 为子层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>。子层以限制映射从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 继承的实际子函子表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span> 为站点箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(C)\">\\(J(C)\\)</span> 为覆盖筛族。以下定义的子函子限制映射均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i\\right)(C):=\\{x\\in F(C)\\mid\\forall i\\in I\\ x\\in A_i(C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i\\right)(C):=\\{x\\in F(C)\\mid\\forall i\\in I\\ x\\in A_i(C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i\\right)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists i\\in I\\ F(u)(x)\\in A_i(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i\\right)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists i\\in I\\ F(u)(x)\\in A_i(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\Rightarrow_F B)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (F(u)(x)\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow F(u)(x)\\in B(D))\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\Rightarrow_F B)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (F(u)(x)\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow F(u)(x)\\in B(D))\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto F(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_F B\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto F(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_F B\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子层判别是：一个子预层对覆盖中的局部成员关系封闭，便是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的子层。交逐点满足此条件。局部并的限制稳定性来自覆盖拉回；覆盖的传递性保证局部封闭，从而它确为子层，且是包含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 的最小子层。蕴含的限制稳定性显然；局部封闭由覆盖拉回后利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的层条件证明。它满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap A\\subseteq B\\Leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow B)\">\\(T\\cap A\\subseteq B\\Leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow B)\\)</span>。特别地空并不必逐点取空集：若空筛覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，初层在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上也有唯一截面。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，III.8, pp.145–147。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,A_i\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"J(C)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i\\right)(C):=\\{x\\in F(C)\\mid\\forall i\\in I\\ x\\in A_i(C)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i\\right)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists i\\in I\\ F(u)(x)\\in A_i(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(A\\Rightarrow_F B)(C):=\\left\\{x\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (F(u)(x)\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow F(u)(x)\\in B(D))\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto F(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}A_i,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}^{J}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_F B\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap A\\subseteq B\\Leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow B)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":2386,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations|df-202 — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations]]"},{"id":"d8548b49e60e0239","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations|df-202 — 站点上子层的交、局部并与蕴含]]"}],"outgoing":["74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","e21364f5dcced9e7","3fcbbf29a7947555"]}